# The Rust compiler, built from SOURCE (D23, 2026-09-26). It is a build
# dependency of the trunk itself -- media-libs/mesa, dev-vcs/git,
# gnome-base/librsvg, dev-util/bindgen -- so an image that cannot rebuild them
# cannot be maintained. Selecting dev-lang/rust here is what makes Portage use it
# over dev-lang/rust-bin: packages depend on `|| ( rust-bin rust )` for a slot.
# Measured on the built trunk: 5 packages (rust, rust-common, lld-22 and its
# symlinks, oniguruma); system-llvm on the trunk's llvm-22, bootstrapped from the
# trunk's own rust-bin-1.98.1 -- no extra rust-bin, unlike F41's August numbers.
dev-lang/rust
